 href="http://www.sflack.com/index.php?option=com_content&amp;task=view&amp;id=63&amp;Itemid=63">official
announcement</a> has more details.<br>
</p>
<p>How to get the Sflack(R) release:
<br>
<br>
The Sflack release may be obtained be anonymous FTP from
<br>
<a href="http://ftp.sflack.com" target="_blank">ftp.sflack.com</a> in
directory /pub/sflack.
<br>
</p>
<p>Thanks to everyone who contributed improvements and fixes this time
--
a lot of help made this a relatively smooth release. </p>
<p> Thanks!!! </p>
